    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Grimes are delighted to present No. 54A Kelly`s Bay Promenade to the market. No. 54A is a delightful two-bedroom detached bungalow, ideally positioned at the end of a quiet cul-de-sac overlooking a large green area, in the popular seaside town of Skerries. Built in 2004, this charming home offers a rare opportunity to acquire a detached property with a private garden and convenient off-street parking.\n\nPerfectly suited to those seeking a peaceful home by the sea, the property combines comfortable single-level living with excellent outdoor space. The private garden provides a lovely setting for relaxing, entertaining or enjoying the fresh coastal air. The property is ideally located within easy reach of Skerries town centre, its beautiful beaches, harbour, coastal walks, cafs, restaurants and local amenities, making it an appealing choice for homeowners looking to enjoy everything this vibrant coastal community has to offer.\n\n54A Kelly`s Bay Promenade presents a wonderful opportunity to create a comfortable home in a peaceful and highly desirable coastal location.\n\nEntrance Hall\n5.75m x 1.33m and 4.13m x 0.90m With tiled floor\n\nLiving Room\n5.40m x 4.55m Wooden flooring, feature bay window, fireplace and coving. Door to side entrance, TV point,\n\nKitchen\n2.77m x 1.76m Floor and wall mounted units, tilled floor and splashback. Plumbed for washing machine. Window.\n\nMaster Bedroom\n4.47m x 3.00m Double bedroom with fitted wardrobes, carpet and french doors to the rear garden.\n\nBedroom 2\n3.58m x 2.89m With fitted wardrobes and carpet flooring. Attic access.\n\nBathroom\n2.69m x 1.77m Tiled Floor, bath with shower attachment, WHB WC\n\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Detached bungalow\nTwo double bedrooms\nOff street parking\nPrivate rear garden\nOverlooking large green area\nBright and spacious accommodation\nEasy walking distance of Skerries Point Shopping Center"
      },
